  "docs": {
    "description": "Compact card that reports the status of one thing — a device, service or job — with a feedback-coloured indicator, title and value. 16 variants: status (success, neutral, danger, warning) × state (default, hover, disabled) plus ghost=true per status. ghost is the skeleton placeholder while data loads. Status is conveyed by icon + label, not colour alone. For KPI numbers use Stat Card; for an actionable alert use Insight Card.",
    "figmaIssues": []
  },
